# Local machine state: which AgentCore workspace this checkout is pointed at.
.cube-session

# wrangler's local scratch for `pages dev` and deploys. Empty today, so it has never
# shown up in git status — it would the first time anyone ran the site locally.
.wrangler/

# One timestamped file per harness run (spike/harness/agentcore.mjs --out defaults to
# this directory), so tracking them means the repo grows with every measurement. The
# findings live in spike/RESULTS.md and agentcore-harness-final.json is kept as the run
# behind them; the intermediates stay on disk and out of git.
spike/results/agentcore-*Z.json
